      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0015:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0015",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc convolution7X7(inputImage: CIImage) -> CIImage? {\n    let convolutionFilter = CIFilter.convolution7X7()\n    convolutionFilter.inputImage = inputImage\n    let weights: [CGFloat] = [\n        0, 0, -1, -1, -1, 0, 0,\n        0, -1, -3, -3, -3, -1, 0,\n        -1, -3, 0, 7, 0, -3, -1,\n        -1, -3, 7, 25, 7, -3, -1,\n        -1, -3, 0, 7, 0, -3, -1,\n        0, -1, -3, -3, -3, -1, 0,\n        0, 0, -1, -1, -1, 0, 0\n    ]\n    let kernel = CIVector(values: weights, count: 49)\n    convolutionFilter.weights = kernel\n    convolutionFilter.bias = 0.0\n    return convolutionFilter.outputImage!\n}\n```",
